WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
In order not to starve to death these days

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:02,920
You caught the rabbit we caught

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:07,200
Don't throw away any bones, smash them all, make soup, and come with me to collect pine needles.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:08,800
Collect leaves

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,200
That stuff is bitter and sexy, and you'll know what it can be used for later.

6
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:17,440
Rub those pine needles off, boil them in water and drink them, nothing will happen.

7
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:25,810
Why did the tooth fall out if it wasn’t Brother Mou Chuan?

8
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:27,010
