11
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,170
They obviously have so much fish to eat

12
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:34,610
Why are you so hungry?

13
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:35,730
This is called rabbit hunger syndrome

14
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:41,020
A person with Rabbit Hungry Syndrome cannot survive on lean meat alone.

15
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,380
The hare is here and there

16
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,460
All pure lean meat

17
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,500
There is almost no grease at all. If a person is alone for a long time

18
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,580
Only eat this pure lean meat

19
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:48,780
There is a lack of fat in the body

20
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:50,220
The dirty air of digesting meat

21
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,860
It will be worn down little by little.
